title: Banned
subtitle: A party paper is closed by order.
new-page: true
tags: event
priority: -1
view-if: {!
if (typeof RG === 'undefined') { return false; }
if (!RG.lw && this.game.scenes.lw_lib) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
return !!(RG.lw && RG.lw.ready('paper_banned'));
!}
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.lw) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.lw_lib.onArrival); }
RG.lw.fire('paper_banned');
Q.lw_n = RG.lw.rnd(2, 6);
Q.lw_paper_cap = Q.lw_paper.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + Q.lw_paper.slice(1);
RG.news(Q.lw_paper_cap + ' banned for ' + Q.lw_n + ' weeks', 2);
!}

= Banned

A police officer with a typed order came to the printing works this morning: **[+ lw_paper_cap +]** is banned for [+ lw_n +] weeks under the emergency decree, for an article about the police in [+ lw_d_name +]. The formes are sealed, and the printers are standing in the yard waiting to hear whether they will be paid this week.

- @rename: Bring it out tomorrow under another name.
- @court: Fight the ban in the courts.
- @printers: Call out the printers of the city.

@rename
subtitle: Readers love the trick. The police will try again, harder.
on-arrival: {!
RG.district(Q.lw_d, {loyalty: 5, repression: 5});
!}

The next morning a new paper appears in [+ lw_town +], with a new name, the same editor and, on the front page, the article that got the old one banned.

@court
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Our lawyers think the decree will not stand up, more likely than not.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
if (Math.random() < 0.55) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -8});
} else {
    Q.lw_out = 2;
}
RG.lw.lean('unionist', 1, 3);
!}

[? if lw_out = 1 : The administrative court lifts the ban after nine days. ?][? if lw_out = 2 : The court upholds the ban and adds the costs. ?]

@printers
subtitle: If the compositors stop, no paper in the city appears. If they do not, ours are sacked.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lw_d_mil >= 55 || Math.random() < 0.3) {
    Q.lw_out = 1;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {repression: -6, militancy: 5});
    Q.worker_support += 2;
} else {
    Q.lw_out = 2;
    RG.district(Q.lw_d, {members: -0.03});
}
RG.lw.lean('offensive', 1, 2);
!}

[? if lw_out = 1 : The next morning no newspaper at all appears in [+ lw_town +]. On the third day the ban is withdrawn. ?][? if lw_out = 2 : The printers' union says it does not strike for party papers. Our compositors come out alone, and are replaced. ?]
